  "display_name": "shipstatic/mcp",
  "description": "[ShipStatic](https://www.shipstatic.com) deploys static sites instantly from AI agents. No account, no API key, no configuration needed.\n\n## How it works\n\n1. Call `deployments_upload` with a build output directory\n2. Site is live immediately at a unique URL\n3. Response includes a claim URL — the user visits it to keep the site permanently\n\nWithout credentials, deployments are public and expire in 3 days. With a free API key, deployments are permanent and tied to the user's account.\n\n## Setup\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"shipstatic\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"@shipstatic/mcp\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nNo `SHIP_API_KEY` needed. For permanent deployments, get a free key at [my.shipstatic.com/api-key](https://my.shipstatic.com/api-key).\n\n## Tools\n\n**Deployments** — upload, list, get, set labels, remove\n\n**Domains** — create/update, list, get, DNS records, DNS provider lookup, shareable setup link, validate, verify, remove\n\n**Account** — whoami",
